Notes Tech is a fully local Android note-taking app: Markdown notes in a
SQLCipher database, per-folder vaults encrypted with AES-256-GCM, and
on-device Whisper voice dictation.

Third-party components: see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the full list of
Dart/Flutter dependencies and their licenses.

Speech recognition models (NOT bundled, imported by the user from the
official source):
- Whisper Base / Tiny — OpenAI, ggml port by Georgi Gerganov, MIT

Bundled as a declared asset of the whisper_ggml_plus package:
- Silero VAD model — Silero Team, MIT

Files Tech sibling module:
- files_tech_voice (Apache 2.0) — on-device Whisper.cpp wrapper
